		
        
        VTOP 1.0  SlickTops BBS Activity Chart

          A new SLICK UTILITY from REFLEX!

              Coded by: BUGBYTE/RLX
              Docs by:  The Minstrel

--------------------------------------------------------
Introduction:

        So you like those Top Uploader thingy's huh? 
Well, this thing goes WAY beyond that.. This door lets
you view 13 different things, from top leechers, to a full 
userlist, to a top CPS chart.. Its number of users to show
for each catagory is selectable by you, ANY number of users.
It takes the info you provide (VERY EASY) and spits out a 
bulletin for you to view.. There are so many options, and
things for you to view, from a Sysops, Sub-Ops, or curious
users point of view, its PERFECT.. There have been MANY Top
UPLOADER doors out there, but this is the first USER driven,
customizable, run on the fly door for /X.. Congratulations
on leeching this door.. 

----------------------------------------------------------
Installation:

        Well, the installation is easy as hell.. There are 
only 3 files that you need for this to work.

1. Copy Vtop to your DOORS: dir.

2. Copy Slicktop to your C: dir.

3. Copy Vtop.info to your BBS:commands/BBSCMDS dir.

Thats it! Youre ready to fly! Its worth it.. 

